The program also includes error handling for file operations and memory allocation, and optimizes performance by minimizing memory usage and preventing system crashes under high load. It also supports real-time updates by processing new incoming lines as they are added to the file without reprocessing previously processed lines. Additionally, it provides logging capabilities for debugging and monitoring purposes, including tracking the number of lines processed, memory usage, and potential errors encountered during execution.']

