The code also includes a feature to compute the MD5 hash of a string provided as an external input, which utilizes the `md5Hash` function from the standard library. This feature is implemented using the `MD5_CTX` structure and the `MD5Init`, `MD5Update`, and `MD5Final` functions from the `md5.h` header file.

