The code also includes error handling and exception-safe design principles to ensure that the function can handle potential integration issues and data mismatches gracefully. The `assert` statements are used to check for invalid input parameters, while the `MD5_CTX` structure is used to handle any exceptions that may occur during the MD5 hash computation.']

