The cache size is fixed at 1000 entries, with a maximum of 10,000 concurrent accesses per second. The eviction policy is set to LRU (Least Recently Used), which ensures efficient memory usage and optimal performance under high concurrency. The cache also supports a configurable grace period for evicted resources before they are fully removed, allowing for potential reinsertion within this period.

