ce. Leverages external libraries for efficient I/O operations, but ensures the function remains self-contained and maintainable. Implements a switch statement to determine the potential issues of a service based on its current state, utilizing a library function to retrieve the service's health status and another library function to obtain the service's name, returning these issues as a string. The function also handles edge cases, such as malformed user IDs or incomplete session data, gracefully and with clear error messages."]

