The logging system provides detailed insights into cache hit/miss rates, evictions, and other performance metrics, which should be configurable and easily extendable. Memory fragmentation is mitigated by using a custom allocator that ensures contiguous memory blocks are allocated for the cache entries.

The solution is modular, allowing for easy integration with different web frameworks and programming languages. It also supports high loads efficiently, handling up to 10,000 requests per second while maintaining reliable and responsive service under heavy concurrency.']

