The `addCrcIndicationPduToList` function adds a new PDU to the list, while the `removeCrcIndicationPduFromList` function removes an existing PDU from the list. Both functions acquire and release the mutex for concurrent access to the list.

The `validateCrcIndicationList` function validates the integrity of all CRC flags in the list, while the `validateCrcIndicationPdu` function validates a single PDU. Both functions acquire and release the mutex for concurrent access to the list.

Finally, the `freeCrcIndicationList` function frees the memory allocated for the list of CRC indication PDUs. It also releases the mutex for concurrent access to the list.']

