The `ResetRange` method resets the range to its default values of `int.MinValue` and `int.MaxValue`.

The `ValidateRange` method validates the range parameters before use, returning false if the minimum value is greater than the maximum value.

The `ToString` method overrides the `Object.ToString()` method and returns a string representation of the current range in the format `[min, max]`.']

