The cache is also optimized for low-latency access patterns, balancing the trade-off between write performance and read performance, and ensures that the cache is resilient to network partitions and node failures. The cache provides logging and monitoring capabilities to track cache performance and identify bottlenecks, enabling proactive tuning and scaling of the cache infrastructure.']

